    "detailed_description": "Neon Fantasy: Monkeys is the perfect puzzle game for a fun and rewarding pastime. Collect pictures, develop your attention, and feel like a part of the beautiful neon world.<br><br>Neon Fantasy: Monkeys is a puzzle game featuring beautiful monkeys in a neon style.<br>Your goal is to assemble a picture of neon monkeys that has been cut into an equal number of pieces.<br><br>The game features several levels of difficulty, allowing you to choose the optimal level for your experience and mood. Regardless of the difficulty, you can enjoy high-quality images of monkeys in bright neon style.<br><br>In Neon Fantasy: Monkeys:<br><br>\u202250 levels<br>\u2022Neon art<br>\u2022Simple controls (mouse)<br>\u2022Achievements<br>\u2022Relaxing music<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668020/extras/826ed75de2ec9ba030f425c716285b29.poster.avif?t=1745463465\" width=605 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668020/extras/826ed75de2ec9ba030f425c716285b29.webm?t=1745463465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668020/extras/55c2cdec9350e5e9188b404f052c4245.poster.avif?t=1745463465\" width=605 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668020/extras/55c2cdec9350e5e9188b404f052c4245.webm?t=1745463465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668020/extras/70333202d4461423baf2460e03d2dfdd.poster.avif?